"\n"
"This module extends the functionality of product module to allow to set\n"
"some data related to fishing areas and capture technologies as\n"
"attributes.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Sales > Configuration > Products > Attribute Values*\n"
"\n"
"   - Update fish FAO areas if you want\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Sales > Configuration > Settings*\n"
"\n"
"   - Active \"Variants and Options\" and apply changes\n"
"\n"
"2. Go to *Sales > Products > Products*\n"
"\n"
"   - In *Variants* tab you can add *FAO Fishing Areas* attribute and\n"
"     select an attribute value.\n"
"\n"
